 Remark 5.2 . 
 
 Theorem  4.1  is stronger than Conjecture 4.2. The global inequality  n ⁡ ( G ) ≥ 3 ​ α ​ ( G ) n(G)\geq 3\alpha(G)  is needed only for maximum independent sets. Every non-maximum independent set in a connected  𝐖 2 \mathbf{W}_{2}  graph satisfies the  2 2 -quasi-regularizability inequality automatically. 
 
 
 
 
