proving: the formalization-and-proving stage is implemented and integrated
(§ 3.5 ) but has not yet been run on the candidate conjectures. Our immediate next
step is to run proof search over the surviving conjectures translated to Lean—together with a preamble-specific
lemma library to ground the provers on the custom invariants, which we anticipate to be the main obstacle
